**Given:**

**Expression:** {1 / 0.01} × {[(5 / 8) + 0.25] × (4 / 5)}

**Formula used:**

**BODMAS** Rule (Brackets, Orders, Division, Multiplication, Addition, Subtraction)

**Calculations:**

{1 / 0.01} × {[(5 / 8) + 0.25] × (4 / 5)}

⇒ 100 × {[(5 / 8) + (2 / 8)] × (4 / 5)}

⇒ 100 × {7 / 8 × 4 / 5}

⇒ 100 × 28 / 40

⇒ 100 × 7 / 10

⇒ 10 × 7

⇒ 70

**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**
